==Battleground==
*3 [[Devil Wife|Devil Wives]] spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Midnite D.]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Le'Behemoth]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Midnite D.|Midnite Ds]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
**6 [[Devil Wife|Devil Wives]] spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**1 [[Deathkory]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Like all the other stages in Aku Citadel, most of the same units that were helpful in previous floors will most likely be useful here. Using a specialist meatshield like [[Maize Cat (Rare Cat)|Cone Cat]] or [[Ancient Egg: N003 (Special Cat)|Cat Cactus]] to stall the first Midnite D. will be sufficient to start.

It is advised you use [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bullet Train Cat]] to kill the Devil Wife for extra money as well. Once you have killed the Devil Wife, spawning a [[Talents|Talented]] [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] should make quick work of the first Midnite D. when timed properly. Once the base is hit, you will be tasked with killing a buffed Le'Behemoth, a Deathkory and three more Midnite Ds. Cone and Cactus should still be able to hold the frontline here, but with the presence of deathkory, it is advised you bring [[Immune to Waves|Wave Immune]] backliners or [[Wave Shield|Wave Blockers]] to allow [[Shield Piercing|Shield Piercers]] like [[Ancient Egg: N109 (Rare Cat)|Barrel Cat]] and [[Ancient Egg: N004 (Special Cat)|Supercar Cat]] to break Deathkory and Le'Behemoth's Shield. [[Pied Piper Cat (Rare Cat)|Brass Cat]] can also be used as a Shield Piercer here with [[Weaken]] as a bonus, but be wary that he doesn't have the bulk to survive the Waves like Barrel, or Supercar's speed.

When timed correctly, a second Talented Awakened Bahamut Cat can dispose of the three Midnite D.s as well as the first one. In the event that you have completed [[Infernal Tower]] first, [[Master Uril (Special Cat)|Esoteric Uril]] makes this stage a joke, it's just a matter of keeping him protected with meatshields.

==='''Recommended Ubers'''===
*[[Yamii (Uber Rare Cat)|Yaminora]]: Can tank the Akus, block Deathkory's waves and weaken all of the enemies.
*[[Kaoru Hanayama (Uber Rare Cat)|Kaoru Hanayama]]: Can melt every enemy here while being able to tank the Wave Attacks from Deathkory with complete ease.
*[[Summoner Satoru (Uber Rare Cat)|Devil Hunter Satoru]]: Is generally just great against Aku provided you have a reliable Wave Shield.

